WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.690
Jump into the door and acquire new power.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:08.150
ZEXAL!

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.070
What?

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:13.330
I’m super kattobing!

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:18.160
Yuma and I build the Overlay Network!

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:21.920
Xyz Change ZEXAL!

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:27.670
Go, ZEXAL Weapon!

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.760
Unicorn Slash!

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:39.890
Yuma!

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:44.960
Yuma...

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:51.230
Yuma Tsukumo...

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:55.510
Kaito!

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:12.590
Haruto, just wait.

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:15.050
I’ll eventually settle things with him.

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:23.320
I’m late!

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:24.560
Wait, Yuma!

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:27.440
What is it? I’m in a hurry!

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:31.770
Last night, you came home in tatters.

00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:39.450
This article says that a warehouse was destroyed at the pier. Were you involved?

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:43.120
Me? Of course not.

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:45.850
The accident seems fishy.

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:50.630
Heartland owns the warehouse and is controlling the news, so no one knows the cause.

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:52.080
I’m late!

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:53.300
Yuma!

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:56.590
This is bad!

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:01.030
What’s bad?

00:02:01.670 --> 00:02:04.270
I see. Your sister.

00:02:04.270 --> 00:02:08.350
But it’s good that we retrieved
the King’s Key and Shark’s soul.

00:02:08.970 --> 00:02:11.140
And you too.

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:14.980
But I was a bit startled.

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:20.160
I never expected him to enter the King’s Key.

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:23.160
Number Hunter Kaito...

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:27.810
He keeps surprising us.

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:30.420
Who is he?

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:43.260
Kaito is full of mysteries.

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:47.100
But there’s one thing we know.

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.850
He can control the Numbers.

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:58.190
In our previous duels against duelists who used Numbers, they were overtaken by the Numbers.

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:05.410
But that wasn’t the case with Kaito.

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:13.500
He may be using an otherworldly power.

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:16.340
Like what?

00:03:16.820 --> 00:03:22.760
I don’t know, but his Galaxy-Eyes...

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:28.750
The light inside his monster
seems similar to that of my world.

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:34.860
Why is he collecting Numbers in the first place?

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:37.860
Numbers are your memories, right?

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:42.570
I think he’s trying to kill my existence.

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:44.380
Kill?

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:45.800
That’s right.

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:49.830
If I regain my memories,
something bad may happen.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:58.000
Anyway, all we know is that everything he does is for his younger brother Haruto.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:02.520
I sold my soul to the devil for my younger brother.

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:07.220
That was Haruto in the photo.

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:10.180
Oh no! I’m late!

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:14.040
That cloud...

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:20.010
What’s up, Kotori!

00:04:20.010 --> 00:04:21.740
This isn’t the time for “what’s up!”

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:32.580
Damn! We’re late!

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:35.820
It’s your fault, Yuma!

00:04:35.820 --> 00:04:40.590
You made me worry so much
yesterday that I overslept!

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:45.430
Astral, you’re also responsible!

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:47.440
I know you’re here!

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:49.570
I’m late...

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:52.060
Calm down.

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:55.770
But I’m glad you’re safe, Astral.

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:57.780
You’re facing the wrong direction.

00:04:57.780 --> 00:04:59.260
Did you say something?

00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:00.270
No.

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:02.740
Yuma!

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:06.200
You’re late too?

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:08.920
I was so excited that I couldn’t fall asleep.

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:11.660
To summarize, we were exhausted.

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:14.870
Thank you for yesterday!

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:15.690
Good morning.

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:17.680
Cat!

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:19.340
Yesterday was fun.

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:20.950
Really?

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:23.180
I didn’t get to go.

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:24.600
Tokunosuke?

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:26.420
I heard what happened.

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:29.200
We were in a rush.

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:33.820
We’re still late!

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:36.820
I haven’t finished talking!

00:05:44.980 --> 00:05:46.320
What’s this?

00:05:57.440 --> 00:05:59.500
Can it be?

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:02.180
Yes, time has stopped.

00:06:02.180 --> 00:06:04.010
Kaito did this?

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:07.850
No, this is something different.

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:15.680
Whether it’s rain, wind, blizzard or the scorching sun

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:18.810
They give color to each day
Will and love keep me from losing heart

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:21.610
Your kindness was harsh
I learned frustration when we clashed

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:25.990
Freedom begins by accepting differences Dance and create the universe

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:33.370
In truth, I was sad until I met you

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:39.790
I lied, thinking it was easier to be alone

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:46.460
Even though we don’t like the same books or hobbies

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:50.340
You’re the only one who agreed with me

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:53.470
Joy and sadness and anger and do re mi fa so la ti do

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:55.220
There’s no harmony and scenario without differences

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:58.640
Everyone is not the same

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:03.560
That’s the reason for living

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:08.820
Even if the sounds are dissonant at times

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:14.240
That’s why I never give up
I believe my strength will get me through

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:17.500
I travel to the edge of the world

00:07:18.020 --> 00:07:21.960
The sights I see with you are the truth

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:24.790
Whether it’s rain, wind, blizzard or the scorching sun

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:28.050
They give color to each day
Will and love keep me from losing heart

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:31.430
Your kindness was harsh
I learned frustration when we clashed

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:35.100
Freedom begins by accepting differences Dance and create the universe

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:44.940
Dr. Faker, what happened?

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:50.950
There were surges from the Astral World and another world, and they overlapped with our world.

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:55.620
\hThe Time Approaches — Three Suns Appear\h

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:55.620
Number 25:

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:55.620
It caused time to stop temporarily.

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:57.830
What’s going to happen?

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.090
There’s no need to panic.

00:08:00.090 --> 00:08:05.330
The surges will leave our world in a few hours, and things will return to normal.

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:11.180
But there’s no doubt
that the two worlds are coming closer.

00:08:11.180 --> 00:08:15.920
There’s not much time until the final stage.

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:18.810
Before that happens,
the Astral World must be...

00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:21.340
Look, Yuma!

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:22.770
What’s going on?

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:28.730
Three suns?

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:33.750
One of the suns is from my world.

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:41.620
I can’t believe this is happening.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:47.370
You’re certain that this is the spot?

00:08:47.370 --> 00:08:48.000
Yes!

00:08:48.470 --> 00:08:52.410
I retraced their memories through space-time.

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:55.680
The memories of their duels begin here.

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:00.640
This is Astral’s memory.

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:08.810
Summon me. Summon the Number.

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:12.610
What’s going on?
I’m brimming with power!

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:20.120
Come, Number 17: Leviathan Dragon!

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:28.000
Number?

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:29.930
Stand up.

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:35.220
We’ll win.

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:37.660
The requirements have been met.

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:38.180
What?

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:40.850
Look at your Extra Deck.

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:47.060
Number 39: Utopia.

00:09:47.530 --> 00:09:49.730
This is a Number?

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:53.230
That’s right. You were given that power.

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:55.540
I’m kattobing!

00:09:55.540 --> 00:10:00.460
I overlay Level 4 Gagaga Magician
and Ganbara Knight!

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:06.410
Appear, Number 39: Utopia!

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:28.520
Utopia is the key
to defeating Leviathan Dragon!

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:31.480
It’s no good.
Yuma is going to lose.

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:32.730
Oh no!

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:38.860
It must mean that you’ve
given up on something!

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:41.870
You must have given up
on something important!

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:50.020
Since I never give up,
I can always kattobing!

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:51.970
I’ll show you!

00:10:51.970 --> 00:10:54.420
Utopia, kattobing!

00:10:55.260 --> 00:10:59.160
Attack Leviathan Dragon!

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:13.400
Astral!

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:14.880
What’s wrong?

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:18.230
I feel like my head is splitting apart!

00:11:19.180 --> 00:11:23.080
Someone is meddling with my memories.

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:27.200
Yuma, let’s retrace the memories of our duels.

00:11:28.630 --> 00:11:30.210
Hey, wait!

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:37.180
That’s where the third Number appeared.

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:44.800
With these three monsters,
I build the Overlay Network!

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:51.390
An Xyz Monster using three monsters?

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:54.330
Appear, Number 34!

00:11:56.650 --> 00:12:00.190
Terror-Byte!

00:12:08.130 --> 00:12:10.500
Astral...

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:13.710
How are you able to separate from me?

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:18.880
It must be because the sun from my world appeared.

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:21.920
So is there someone here?

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:25.050
No, but someone was here.

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:30.020
Wait, Astral!

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:37.860
This is where we dueled against Tokunosuke.

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:39.490
That’s right.

00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:46.370
Since he took our Numbers, I lost consciousness and had to leave the dueling to you.

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:48.700
Yeah.

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:53.790
Since you told me to protect Baby Tiragon,
I was able to make a comeback.

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:56.390
Prepare yourself!

00:12:56.390 --> 00:12:59.960
I activate the Continuous Trap Ultra C!

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:03.300
He stole Utopia!

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:08.270
Baby Tiragon’s effect activates!

00:13:08.270 --> 00:13:11.940
Utopia, attack him directly!

00:13:11.940 --> 00:13:15.940
Go! Hope Sword Slash!

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:23.440
All right! It’s over!

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:35.160
This is the memory of the fourth Number.

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:36.370
Duel!

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:41.960
Then I overlay three Level 1 Trions!

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:47.820
With these three monsters,
I build the Overlay Network!

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:49.930
Xyz Summon!

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:55.020
Appear, Number 83: Galaxy Queen!

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:57.230
A Number appeared!

00:13:57.780 --> 00:13:59.400
Galaxy Queen!

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:02.730
We now have all the pieces for victory.

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:04.990
Here I go!

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:08.070
I’m kattobing!

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:11.450
Utopia attacks Galaxy Queen!

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:15.830
Hope Sword Slash!

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:19.560
This monster is attacked instead!

00:14:31.280 --> 00:14:36.480
I also dueled Cat when Kotori was kidnapped.

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:39.810
Yuma is looking at me.

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:44.190
Twin Tail Cat Lady, make Yuma my prisoner!

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:46.690
Attack him directly!

00:14:49.090 --> 00:14:51.820
Yuma, I lov—

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:53.740
Go, Baby Tiragon!

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:56.200
Baby Stream!

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:03.710
Why?

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:10.380
This is where Shark and I had our tag duel.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:12.300
That’s right.

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:15.890
This is where we retrieved our fifth and sixth Numbers.

00:15:16.940 --> 00:15:21.850
I broke my promise and used a Number, but I still lost against Shark.

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:26.060
I fought again for myself!

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:35.160
I overlay Level 5 Flamesaurus
and Baggy Pants Lavasaurus!

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:38.830
With these two monsters,
I build the Overlay Network.

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:41.080
Xyz Summon!

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:44.470
Appear, Number 61!

00:15:45.740 --> 00:15:48.670
Volcasaurus!

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:58.090
Two Level 5 monsters!

00:15:58.090 --> 00:16:04.430
Appear, Number 19: Freezerdon!

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:10.110
This is where we dueled against Kaito.

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:11.690
That’s right.

00:16:11.690 --> 00:16:13.490
The Number Hunter Kaito.

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:20.910
He displayed overwhelming power,
and our duel could be considered a defeat.

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:25.720
I’ll hunt your soul!

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:28.800
Go, Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:30.710
Astral!

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:35.220
This is the end.

00:16:39.530 --> 00:16:41.180
We’ll continue this duel later!

00:16:46.640 --> 00:16:50.190
But we didn’t stay the same either.

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:56.160
We learned something important from Rokujuro at the Duel Sanctuary.

00:16:56.160 --> 00:17:01.830
I’ll swallow your light, kid!

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:06.240
I overlay Level 5 Earth Armor Ninja
and Flame Armor Ninja!

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:10.340
Come, Number 12!

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:15.150
Crimson Shadow Armor Ninja!

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:27.850
When we fought against Jin, we gained a new power known as Utopia Ray!

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:30.060
Xyz Summon!

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:33.110
Appear, Number 16!

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:36.110
The ruler of color!

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:41.650
Shock Master!

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:43.700
Can it be?

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:47.290
Appear, Number 11!

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:51.660
The ruler with the bewitching eye! Big Eye!

00:17:54.720 --> 00:18:01.430
You’re my dear friend, Astral!

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:04.220
I was scared too.

00:18:04.220 --> 00:18:08.580
But there’s always hope
as long as you don’t give up!

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:09.940
Kattobing!

00:18:10.470 --> 00:18:11.900
Yuma...

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:19.780
I want to win for you and your friends!

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:27.830
You’re...

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:32.540
Let’s win, Yuma.

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:35.010
Astral, let’s go!

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:37.090
My turn!

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:39.250
I draw!

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:44.590
We’ve assembled
the new formula for victory!

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:45.930
What’s this?

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:50.100
The power of hope. The messenger who changes chaos into light.

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:51.900
Number C39.

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:54.400
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:59.270
Appear now, Number C39!

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:04.530
Utopia Ray!

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:10.500
Utopia Ray’s effect activates!

00:19:11.150 --> 00:19:19.160
Utopia Ray can use
an Overlay Unit to gain 500 ATK!

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:28.980
I use all three Overlay Units!

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:34.390
Utopia Ray gains ATK!
Overlay Charge!

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:38.110
No way!

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:41.610
Go, Utopia Ray!

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:44.740
Attack Big Eye!

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:49.540
Hope Sword Chaos Slash!

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:09.890
Obomi also became our newest friend!

00:20:16.510 --> 00:20:20.890
This is their final memory about Numbers.

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:23.140
What’s this?

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:27.200
Astral!

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:32.500
I’ll destroy everything!

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:37.090
What’s this?

00:20:37.640 --> 00:20:40.050
You can no longer escape.

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:43.060
This is my kattobing!

00:20:43.060 --> 00:20:45.590
Hope Sword Slash!

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:56.690
Impossible! I...

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:58.690
Yuma, catch!

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:23.860
Just as I thought, it’s Kaito.

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:46.380
Are you two okay?

00:21:46.380 --> 00:21:48.410
What are you doing?

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:51.050
Where’s Yuma?

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:57.280
We’ll settle things
at the World Duel Carnival.

00:22:04.250 --> 00:22:06.600
I’m looking forward to it.

00:22:12.470 --> 00:22:15.260
Let’s start the duel!

00:22:15.260 --> 00:22:16.980
This week’s quiz:

00:22:16.980 --> 00:22:22.140
If you Xyz Summon using two monsters, how many Overlay Units will you have?

00:22:22.140 --> 00:22:24.530
1 or 2?

00:22:30.070 --> 00:22:34.830
Today’s test is hard
Can’t avoid pleasure and temptation

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:39.920
I want to go home and watch TV
Recent cartoons are entertaining

00:22:49.840 --> 00:22:54.430
Anyway, tests are hard
Language, math and English are especially hard

00:22:54.430 --> 00:22:59.520
Average scores in science and social studies
I’m only good at P.E.

00:22:59.520 --> 00:23:01.940
(Wait, Baby!) The expected

00:23:02.520 --> 00:23:04.570
(What’s that, Baby!) Answers

00:23:04.820 --> 00:23:07.240
(Wait a sec, Baby!) Remember them

00:23:07.240 --> 00:23:08.860
(What are we!? Baby!) For who

00:23:08.860 --> 00:23:13.590
Let’s say I wrote the correct answers on that sheet

00:23:13.590 --> 00:23:18.080
Will that change the future a year or a decade from now?

00:23:18.120 --> 00:23:23.530
The world I drew at the edge of dreams

00:23:23.530 --> 00:23:28.130
Someday I’ll race in the sky

00:23:28.130 --> 00:23:33.260
Nobody can threaten my heart

